# Vercel Deployment Ignore File
# Excludes heavy local assets, raw scrapers, spreadsheets, and scratch files from build bundles

# Heavy raw data and local scrapers (saves ~100MB+ per deployment)
office marketplace data/
client response/
documents/
scratch/
extracted_media/
scripts/

# Raw spreadsheets and PDF documents
*.xlsx
*.csv
*.pdf
*.log

# Documentation and markdown files (not needed in runtime build)
*.md
!README.md

# Testing & coverage
coverage/
.turbo/
